OL,3,GNEWSAWellness retreat and padel plan in
OL,4,ANunnery estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted for a new
OL,7,Fsports and wellness complex at the
OL,8,FNunnery Estate on the outskirts of
OL,9,FDouglas.
OL,11,FIt comes after plans were approved in
OL,12,FJune for a change-of-use for the land
OL,13,Fwithin the large estate.
OL,15,FThe Nunnery is one of the island's most
OL,16,Fhistorical sites, with the legendary
OL,17,Fdate of its founding rooted in the 6th
OL,18,FCentury, although it is more commonly
OL,19,Faccepted as the 12th Century.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
