OL,3,GNEWSAWellness retreat and padel plan in
OL,4,ANunnery estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe application, lodged by Johnny and
OL,7,FLoni Evans, is seeking permission to
OL,8,Fbuild a four-court indoor padel
OL,9,Ffacility with a cafe, swimming pool,
OL,10,Fsauna, changing facilities, as well as
OL,11,Flandscaping works and a "wild spa"
OL,12,Foutside.
